          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "If Columbia ever needs an adjunct professor to teach a course in being amazing, The Lash is happy to oblige.",
          "duration": 7.229
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "I'm shocked you know what an adjunct is.",
          "duration": 2.166
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Lash",
          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "Don't underestimate The Lash professor\u2026 it never works out.",
          "duration": 4.477
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "dynamo_lash_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
