          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "So how long you been with the ol' ball and chain.",
          "duration": 3.871
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "Don't talk about Marla like that.",
          "duration": 1.681
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Lash",
          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo02_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo02_03.mp3",
          "text": "Just making conversation.",
          "duration": 1.846
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "And I'm just telling you to respect my wife.",
          "duration": 2.278
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "dynamo_lash_convo03",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Lash",
          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo03_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo03_01.mp3",
          "text": "What's the first thing you're gonna do once The Lash gets you your body back.",
