        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo03_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_lash_convo03_02.mp3",
          "text": "I believe you mean \"The Patron\", but to answer your question: give Marla a hug and not let go for about 3 months.",
